# Snippets that demonstrate invalid syntax on purpose, one path per line.
#
# The script also honours a "# typoscript-lint: ignore-file" comment inside a
# snippet. That is the better place for it, but not for a file whose content is
# shown to the reader verbatim: the renderer silently ignores the :lines:
# option of literalinclude, so the comment would end up in the example.
Documentation/CodeSnippets/TypoScriptSyntax/CodeBlockInvalidClosingBrace.typoscript
